        // the modal waiting forever, and save effectively deadlocks
        // (root cause of the 5+ minute stalls on DOC-0000, which
        // references EJ Sans Text variants not installed on this box).
        // Stay in NEVER_INTERACT through save in headless mode — the
        // substitution applies silently with whatever fallback the
        // font cache has, save returns immediately. Interactive runs
        // keep the original behaviour so the operator can resolve
        // genuine prompts before the file hits disk.
        if (!__isAutomated) {
            try { app.scriptPreferences.userInteractionLevel = UserInteractionLevels.INTERACT_WITH_ALL; }
            catch (eUI2) { plog("WARN: failed to restore INTERACT_WITH_ALL pre-save: " + eUI2.message); }
        } else {
            plog("bridge: keeping NEVER_INTERACT through save (avoids missing-font dialog deadlock)");
        }

        // #BRIDGE-17: pre-emptively remap every non-INSTALLED font in
        // the doc to a known-installed fallback before workDoc.save().
        // InDesign's save-time "Missing Fonts" dialog category does NOT
        // honor scriptPreferences.userInteractionLevel = NEVER_INTERACT
        // (confirmed via repro on DOC-0000: BRIDGE-7 keeps the
        // flag set, the dialog still pops modally and blocks the main
        // thread for 5+ minutes). If the doc has no missing-font
        // references at all, the dialog never fires. We walk doc.fonts,
        // find each entry whose status != INSTALLED, and use the
        // findText / changeText engine to replace every character
        // currently using that font with the fallback. SHS Regular
        // covers both CJK and Latin glyphs (Latin coverage is mediocre
        // but acceptable in fallback mode); for SHS itself we also
